circuitRF-IHP-SG13G2-PDK
Copyright 2026 aissus

This repository builds a circuitRF device kit from the IHP SG13G2 Open PDK
(https://github.com/IHP-GmbH/IHP-Open-PDK), Copyright IHP PDK Authors, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The kit it builds, and the example inductor, carry material derived
from the PDK:
- the model expressions and corner values of its ngspice model libraries;
- the layer table of its KLayout layer properties (sg13g2.lyp);
- its ITF stackup (libs.tech/parasitics/itf) and its process specification (libs.doc);
- the symbols of its Qucs-S user library (libs.tech/qucs-s/user_lib), by Mike Brinson;
- the geometry of its inductor2 KLayout PCell (sg13g2_pycell_lib), which draws the example
  inductor.

The built kit (kit/, not part of this repository; the release archives carry it) also holds
compiled models:
- R3 (CMC), the PDK's r3_cmc.osdi. The PDK's r3_cmc.va is licensed under the Apache License,
  Version 2.0, and derives from the Si2 CMC model under the Educational Community License,
  Version 2.0.
- VBIC 1.3 (models/osdi/vbic_1p3_5t.osdi, vbic_1p3_bce.osdi, npn13G2*.osdi), compiled with
  OpenVAF from the vbic_1p3.va that VACASK (https://codeberg.org/arpadbuermen/VACASK, licensed
  under the GNU Affero General Public License, Version 3) distributes. That file states no
  license, so this repository holds only the scripts that compile it, never the compiled models.
  The release archives, built by .github/workflows/release.yml, carry them as compiled from that
  source.
